      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `cdd4785b2d27f49181cce635b84f69b372caad8aa70a8afae3373947be63d8d0--personal-crime-tables-13-to-19a-.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Crime Victimisation, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2015-16\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 16 of 16\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 76d90ee46506bcb9b9195c17284675e07b15ab43797809426749eb5d3fd5b5c2 | missing |\n| \"Table 13\" | 5d878a09087f26832be77b01521088f2e533bf2b11d9f49e5caecfa62936b11d | missing |\n| \"Table 13a\" | 997fcefdd892d4e09bb9cda2bd2e8cda0e6d215cef707f8ceaa8088e26c073b5 | missing |\n| \"Table 14\" | 730e96fcd2a6b04b59d990bc9f006569131cd62ad6785b12e650c4adbb603039 | missing |\n| \"Table 14a\" | f573c775221462875449e5010e4887de10a6d097b712504b0a418fd517a5ea8c | missing |\n| \"Table 15\" | aafbcc134a1f97382d29efe92900167e86a23285526f88ec30dc925d9ea38a75 | missing |\n| \"Table 15a\" | 889bba252674d98b4dadbc447f3cd18a5407f994ac4d6d53407a2512c9e85691 | missing |\n| \"Table 16\" | 4e59b590d90219c77312c0127c3d05b65d11ffbacc855a77f794178186b63ebe | missing |\n| \"Table 16a\" | c3f297614f0207d47a2193bb2d6d2900a45eef34f9d021df67e885bd779f4831 | missing |\n| \"Table 17\" | 0ea92c2f0e91b75fd93eee1445f4476f4f8860ae68b1d038034125862d752614 | missing |\n| \"Table 17a\" | 88aa5c080136ad9aa51e0336171b686317498f4f6021e36ac55dcdd5c1bd2c39 | missing |\n| \"Table 18\" | b5813d01778ecdc9ab6eee096c8d4cb868a4a0166166d4488b726d326ecb6313 | missing |\n| \"Table 18a\" | e9a1042039716511bc90a8f1f42a335b2ffba1a840e62c71664b6423792e8a8b | missing |\n| \"Table 19\" | e921e17010c0e217ace1ec3a01709d074a18aeb91e9ac4b34d8c17ab434dfdc6 | missing |\n| \"Table 19a\" | 34482db6625dccb974c2ed2dd89e064d386d32bf51181f6ea88c8b39b1c177c9 | missing |\n| \"Explanatory Notes\" | a80e8c6cb816fe0e9aa4c92adb173fc10d587d0f03f2b328e29894743375d8f1 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
